{"parse": {"title": "交接日-02", "pageid": 123637, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%A4%E6%8E%A5%E6%97%A5-01\" title=\"交接日-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">交接日-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%A4%E6%8E%A5%E6%97%A5-03\" title=\"交接日-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">交接日</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E2.80.9C.E4.B8.8D.E4.BA.8C.E4.BA.BA.E9.80.89.E2.80.9D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"“不二人选”\">“不二人选”</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> “不二人选”</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Ideal Candidate</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">10:00 第一防线学校</span></div>\n<div class=\"no-indent\">\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 06.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">第一防线学校</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>两个女孩一前一后，穿过教学楼旁的林荫小道。<br />\n前面的女孩滔滔不绝，后面的女孩安静地跟随。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“到了！这里就是每天学生们上课的必经之路。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“班长会向我们报告他们的人是不是齐了，有没有人身体不舒服。<br />如果有，我们就需要去看看。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“检测用的还是那一套：取一滴血，滴在装了水的杯子里，如果里面的冷蕨叶子变色了，就是有问题。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“但这套方法有时候没有那么灵敏。如果有的学生看起来真的很难受，这个时候我就会……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“呃，你在听吗？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“当然，玛蒂尔达小姐。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>女孩藏在细框镜片后的双眼短暂地望了过来，目光很快又落回了手中那册笔记本上。<br />\n玛蒂尔达不由得想起，方才纪律主任向自己介绍这位纪律协助教员<span class=\"tooltips\" style=\"cursor: help; color: #ff7a06;\">继任者<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left; translate: 0px;\">“这是拉文德·戴尔小姐。今年的毕业生。”<br />纪律主任将手放上一旁黑发女孩的肩膀。<br />“她是年级中最优秀的那一个，也是最遵守纪律的那一个。”<br />“我确信她是纪律协助教员的不二人选。”</span></span>时的情景。<br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_07.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 07.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Rolestory_madierda_pic_07.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"129\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Rolestory_madierda_pic_07.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Rolestory_madierda_pic_07.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"470\" data-file-height=\"551\" /></a></div>\n<p>向来不苟言笑的纪律主任在望向这个戴眼镜的女孩时，眼中总是写满了欣慰与骄傲，显然是满意得不得了。<br />\n相比之下，她对玛蒂尔达的评价恐怕就截然相反了。<br />\n担任纪律协助教员期间，她们曾多次意见相左。虽然以玛蒂尔达妥协收场的次数更多，但毫无疑问，那些经历于对方而言也称不上舒心……<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“嗯？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_08.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 08.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Rolestory_madierda_pic_08.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"104\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Rolestory_madierda_pic_08.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_08.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Rolestory_madierda_pic_08.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_08.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"470\" data-file-height=\"444\" /></a></div>\n<p>玛蒂尔达回过神来，注意到钢笔划过纸张的声音从未停下。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“你在记什么？我刚才有说那么多东西吗？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“只是补充一些用来提醒自己的备注。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>镜片后的目光很快又落回了<span class=\"tooltips\" style=\"cursor: help; color: #ff7a06;\">笔记本<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left; translate: 0px; min-width:300px;\">——这是一个玛蒂尔达不太愿意提起的话题。<br />上学时，从前在哪里都是第一名的玛蒂尔达·布翁尼小姐在转入第一防线学校后，每次只能屈居第三名。<br />她当时始终搞不明白。明明课都是一起上的，谁也没比谁每天多出一个小时来学习，自己到底差在了哪里？<br />左思右想后，她猜测也许是她们在记录课堂笔记上有什么窍门。<br />直接借来笔记看看是个不错的方法，玛蒂尔达知道那两个人大约都不会拒绝。<br />但她就是开不了这个口。尚且年幼的她始终觉得彼此是竞争对手，不愿做出这种“示弱”的举动。<br />她无数次尝试鼓起勇气，又无数次欲言又止、在对方疑惑的眼神中狼狈逃窜……<br /><br />直到某个上午，一个奇迹般的片刻降临。<br />教室中空无一人，只有孩子们的文具、书本——还有笔记，孤零零地躺在课桌上。<br />恶魔的诱惑也不过如此了。鬼使神差地，她踮着脚尖走近那张不属于自己的课桌……<br /><br />“呀？！”<br />门外传来声响，她像是受惊的兔子一样跳了起来，却不幸地和来人撞了个满怀。<br />嫌犯玛蒂尔达·布翁尼当即落网，“犯罪生涯”就此落幕。<br /><br />但直到今天，她仍然记得当时匆匆一瞥看到的东西。<br />老师提过的问题，老师没有提及的问题，有答案的问题，没有答案的问题……那本笔记的每一页都写得密密麻麻。<br />原来那个对她而言本只是“竞争对手”的橙发女孩，在心里想的事情远比说出来的要多得多。<br />——问题在于，面前的女孩也是如此吗？</span></span>上，书写声仍未停止。<br />\n狐疑的乌云不断胀大，直到一个猜测浮现。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“等等，难道……”<br />\n她想起从清早起始终覆在心头的那个“不好的预感”。<br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_07.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 07.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Rolestory_madierda_pic_07.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"129\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Rolestory_madierda_pic_07.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Rolestory_madierda_pic_07.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"470\" data-file-height=\"551\" /></a></div>\n<p>如果说自己的升职还会出什么岔子，那唯一有可能的……就是纪律主任打算从中作梗。<br />\n也许并不是出于什么恶毒的意图。只是那位已经在纪律主任的位置上呆了几十年，是个十足的老古板。<br />\n其实玛蒂尔达从没有不服管教的意思，只是学校这一套全都太过时了。<br />\n一名出色的神秘学家需要的应该是渊博的知识、开阔的眼界、深厚的神秘学素养、临机应变的判断力……<br />\n总之不该是照着那本不知多久没更新过的《学生守则》，谁活得更像是个木偶谁就更优秀。<br />\n成为纪律协助教员非她本意，但在上任后，她始终致力于把自己认为更好的、更新的东西带到学校里面来——可惜在纪律主任的眼中，这恐怕十恶不赦。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 06.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">第一防线学校·教学楼前</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“不对，不如说，她肯定打从心底这么觉得……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“您说什么？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“没什么！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达打了个激灵，提起了十二分的注意。<br />\n如果她的猜测正确，眼前的这个小学妹就很有可能是纪律主任的“眼线”，是考察自己的“考官”……<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“您刚才说如果有学生看起来真的很难受，您就会——什么？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“没什么！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>通常玛蒂尔达会自己判断那些孩子是装病还是真的不舒服。如果是后者，她就会略施小计。<br />\n但这些话恐怕不说为妙。为了不让升职化为泡影，也许至少在这一天，她应当先藏起自己那些<span class=\"tooltips\" style=\"cursor: help; color: #ff7a06;\">过于先进的主张<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left; translate: 0px; min-width:300px;\">指腹隐隐传来刺痛，但和脑袋里横冲直撞的那股钻心的疼痛比起来，简直不足挂齿。<br />针管抽出的血液落入杯中。可等了半晌，那枚冷蕨叶子仍然翠绿欲滴。<br />“看来……我没什么大碍。对不起，我这就去上课——”<br />“还是躺下吧，你的脸色白得像是血食怪！”<br />她被一把按回了床上。面前的人从怀里掏出钢笔，取出墨水蹭在叶片表面。<br />“好了，叶片变色了！说明你身体不舒服，今天应该休息。”<br />见她目瞪口呆，纪律协助教员向她眨了眨眼。<br />“哼哼，不知道了吧！这是最先进的检测方法。”</span></span>……<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 10.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">教学楼背面</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“接下来我带你去医务室看看。如果有学生生病受伤，但老师不在，就需要我们进行一些应急处理。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“跟我来，从教学楼的背面这一侧过去更近——”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“咦？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达的脚步顿住了，身后的女孩也轻声惊呼。<br />\n二人的目光不约而同地落在高处——在教学楼背面约三层高的位置，两个白色的“布袋”正在踩着窗户的边缘艰难挪动。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“你们两个……在做什么？！”<br />\n</p></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "交接日-02"}}